      "title": "Introduction / ಪರಿಚಯ",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This book switches between English and Kannada in the same chapter. A PDF renderer must keep both scripts intact without corrupting either. ಈ ಪುಸ್ತಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಮತ್ತು ಕನ್ನಡ ಒಂದೇ ಅಧ್ಯಾಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಬರುತ್ತವೆ."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "chapters": [
    {
      "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
      "kind": "main",
      "role": "chapter",
      "title": "Chapter 1 — Bridge Day / ಸೇತುವೆಯ ದಿನ",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000111",
          "level": 2,
          "inlines": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Morning notes / ಬೆಳಗಿನ ಟಿಪ್ಪಣಿಗಳು" }]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000112",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At 7:00 a.m. Anika met her cousin near the old bridge. ಅನಿಕಾ ತನ್ನ ಚಿಕ್ಕಮ್ಮನ ಮಗಳನ್ನು ಹಳೆಯ ಸೇತುವೆಯ ಬಳಿ ಭೇಟಿಯಾದಳು. They counted 12 arches and wrote the number ೧೨ in both scripts."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000113",
          "inlines": [
            { "type": "text", "text": "She said, " },
            { "type": "emphasis", "children": [{ "type": "text", "text": "listen first" }] },
            { "type": "text", "text": " — " },
            { "type": "strong", "children": [{ "type": "text", "text": "ಮೊದಲು ಕೇಳು" }] },
            { "type": "text", "text": " — then write." }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000114",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"A bilingual page is not two books stapled together.\" — «ದ್ವಿಭಾಷಾ ಪುಟವು ಎರಡು ಪುಸ್ತಕಗಳನ್ನು ಜೋಡಿಸಿದ್ದಲ್ಲ.»"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000115",
          "ordered": true,
          "items": [
            [
              { "type": "text", "text": "Photograph the bridge at 08:30 / ಸೇತುವೆಯ ಛಾಯಾಚಿತ್ರ ೦೮:೩೦ಕ್ಕೆ." }
            ],
            [
              { "type": "text", "text": "Interview one shopkeeper / ಒಬ್ಬ ಅಂಗಡಿ ಮಾಲೀಕರನ್ನು ಸಂದರ್ಶಿಸಿ." }
            ],
            [
              { "type": "text", "text": "Draft 800 words in mixed script / ಮಿಶ್ರ ಲಿಪಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ೮೦೦ ಪದಗಳ ಕರಡು." }
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000116",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Prices on the stall sign: tea ₹20, coffee ₹35, bun ₹12.50. English label: Tea 20, Coffee 35, Bun 12.50. The receipt said No. 4419 / ರಶೀದಿ ಸಂಖ್ಯೆ ೪೪೧೯."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000117",
          "level": 3,
          "inlines": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Later / ನಂತರ" }]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000118",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "They walked 2.4 km home. ಅವರು ೨.೪ ಕಿ.ಮೀ. ನಡೆದು ಮನೆಗೆ ಹೋದರು. Night lamps numbered 1–12 / ದೀಪಗಳು ೧–೧೨."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
